  this.cameraX = lerp(this.cameraX, focus, 1 - Math.pow(0.0015, dt));
  const half = this.viewWidth / (2*this.scale);
  const clamped = clamp(this.cameraX, half, this.width-half);
  this.offsetX = this.viewWidth/2 - clamped*this.scale;
}
```
If viewWidth/scale > world width (e.g., narrow weird), half > width-half; clamp min>max. Use if:
```
const viewW = this.viewWidth/this.scale;
if (viewW >= this.width) { offsetX=(vw-width*scale)/2; }
else { ... }
```
cameraFocus method:
```
cameraFocus(game,t) {
 if (game.phase==='menu') return 800+Math.sin(t*0.12)*140;
 const p = game.projectiles.find(p=>p.kind==='rocket')||game.projectiles[game.projectiles.length-1];
 if (p) return clamp(p.x, 0, width);
 if (game.currentWorm) {
   let focus = game.currentWorm.x;
   if (game.charging && game.mouse.active) focus += clamp(game.mouse.x - focus, -140, 140)*0.25;
   return focus;
 }
 return 800;
}
```
Maybe during AI firing follow projectile. Good.

